Contoh jawatan memerlukan calon dinilai melalui PAC: 
 Pegawai Tadbir dan Diplomatik Gred M9; 
 Pegawai Siasatan Gred P9; dan 
 Pegawai Hal Ehwal Islam Gred S9.

Selain itu, PAC juga melibatkan Ujian Bakat bagi jawatan seperti: 
 kemahiran interpersonal; 
 penyelesaian masalah; 
 kepimpinan; 
 Ahli Muzik Gred B9; 
 Pegawai Kebudayaan Gred B9; 
 kerja berpasukan; dan
 kepimpinan; 
 Ahli Muzik Gred B9; 
 Pegawai Kebudayaan Gred B9; 
 kerja berpasukan; dan 
 Artis Budaya Gred B1; dan 
 kebolehan menulis. 

Ujian Kompetensi Pemanduan bagi jawatan Pemandu Kenderaan Gred H1. 

Modul penilaian adalah mengikut keperluan jawatan meliputi aktiviti seperti leaderless group discussion, ujian penulisan serta ujian komunikasi dalam bahasa Melayu, bahasa Inggeris dan bahasa-bahasa lain yang diperlukan.
[EN: Examples of positions requiring candidates to be assessed through PAC: Administrative and Diplomatic Officer Grade M9; Investigation Officer Grade P9; and Islamic Affairs Officer Grade S9. In addition, PAC includes aptitude tests for positions such as Musician Grade B9, Cultural Officer Grade B9, and Cultural Artist Grade B1. Driving Competency Tests are for Vehicle Driver Grade H1. Assessment modules are according to job requirements and include activities such as leaderless group discussion, writing tests, and communication tests in Malay, English and other required languages.]

