Article 50. Grounds for termination of the activity of a civil servant

The following are grounds for terminating the employment of a civil servant:

termination of the employment contract in accordance with labor legislation;

termination of the employment contract in accordance with labor legislation;

Loss of citizenship of the Republic of Uzbekistan by a civil servant;

Chapter 1. General provisions


the entry into legal force of a court judgment on the imposition of a penalty that
excludes the possibility of continuing the activity of a civil servant, as well as a court ruling on
the application of compulsory medical measures against him;

Chapter 2. Public administration
in the field of public civil service


the provision of false information that is relevant to the civil servant's appointment to a
civil service position;

Chapter 3. Legal status of a civil
servant


a corruption-related offense committed by a public civil servant;

a corruption-related offense committed by a public civil servant;

Failure by a civil servant to comply with restrictions related to performing civil service.

